{"version":1,"content":"<p>2001年11月10日，蘋果第一代iPod正式開始銷售。25年後的今天，這款曾經改變全球音樂消費方式的便攜式播放器，已經成為蘋果發展史上最具標誌性的產品之一。它不僅幫助蘋果擺脱了單純的電腦製造商形象，也為後來iPhone、Apple Music等產品和服務奠定了重要基礎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585806.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:32:30.249187+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:07:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:52.093098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:52.093098+00:00","content_hash":"b1794b32fa8132eb9f3a189e215dc11ff603c6af0c5f5e5f4024b82f345780a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}